  ['philippines-hr-new-hire-preboarding-dependency-map','Philippines HR preboarding dependencies: show what can block day one','Map preboarding dependencies across HR, hiring managers, IT, and facilities without promising an outcome no owner has approved.','new-hire preboarding dependencies','which missing dependency blocks a confirmed start','an account request cannot begin because the role owner has not confirmed the start record','reporting every open task as equally urgent','blocked starts with a visible owner and next checkpoint'],
  ['philippines-hr-employee-address-change-control','Philippines HR employee address changes: verify the route before updating','Build a source-backed address-change route with identity checks and owner approval for Philippines HR administration.','employee address-change control','which approved source may change the employee record','an employee sends a change from a personal channel that is not the approved intake','copying the new address into every system before verification','requests with verified source, owner, and downstream acknowledgement'],
  ['philippines-hr-policy-rollout-attestation-gap','Philippines HR policy rollouts: turn attestation gaps into owner actions','Track policy distribution and attestation gaps in a Philippines-based HR support lane without interpreting the policy for employees.','policy rollout attestation gaps','whether a missing attestation needs a reminder, owner review, or exception','a worker says the policy link was inaccessible but the tracker shows sent','measuring sent emails as if they were understood or accepted','gaps with a documented reason and qualified owner'],
  ['philippines-hr-employee-request-categorization','Philippines HR employee requests: use categories that route, not label','Design practical request categories that route Philippines-based HR work to the right owner while preserving the employee’s words.','employee-request categorization','which queue owns the request and what detail must stay restricted','one message includes a routine address update and a sensitive complaint','splitting a message so private context travels into a broad queue','reclassified items corrected before the next response'],
  ['philippines-recruiting-interview-feedback-lock','Philippines recruiting interview feedback: close the collection window safely','Set a feedback-collection window for recruiting support while interviewers and hiring owners retain evaluation and selection authority.','interview feedback collection locks','when collection closes and who may reopen it','one interviewer submits late notes after the panel has already discussed a candidate','editing or summarizing feedback to make the panel look complete','feedback records with source, timestamp, and owner review'],
  ['philippines-hr-employee-file-access-review','Philippines HR employee-file access: review permissions by task','Review access to employee records by task and owner, keeping a Philippines-based admin role narrow and observable.','employee-file access review','which permission is necessary for the next approved task','a role still has access to a folder after its recurring project ended','removing a person from one folder while leaving inherited access elsewhere','permissions with owner, purpose, expiry or review date'],
  ['philippines-hr-training-completion-exceptions','Philippines HR training completion: route exceptions without judging intent','Reconcile training completion records and exception requests while qualified HR owners decide what a missed requirement means.','training completion exceptions','whether evidence supports completion or needs an owner decision','a learning platform marks incomplete while the employee provides an approved attendance record','assuming a technical status proves employee intent or noncompliance','exceptions resolved with source evidence and decision owner'],
  ['philippines-hr-employee-complaint-intake-boundary','Philippines HR complaint intake: make the stop rule visible','Create a narrow complaint-intake handoff that protects the employee’s message and routes it to a qualified HR owner.','employee complaint intake boundaries','what can be acknowledged and what must immediately escalate','an employee begins with a scheduling issue and then describes retaliation','asking follow-up questions that turn an intake clerk into an investigator','complaints transferred with minimum necessary detail and receipt proof'],
  ['philippines-hr-benefits-deadline-exception-log','Philippines HR benefits deadlines: document exceptions before they disappear','Maintain a benefits deadline and exception log for Philippines-based HR support while plan owners decide eligibility and remedies.','benefits deadline exception logging','whether a missed deadline is routine follow-up or an eligibility decision','a document arrives after a cutoff with no visible receipt timestamp','promising acceptance because a file appears complete','exceptions carrying receipt, source, deadline, and decision owner'],
  ['philippines-hris-manager-change-reconciliation','Philippines HRIS manager changes: reconcile effective dates and approvals','Coordinate manager changes across HRIS, directories, and workflow tools without treating a saved field as final approval.','HRIS manager-change reconciliation','which effective date and approval control downstream updates','the HRIS shows a new manager before the organizational owner signs the change','updating downstream tools from the first visible field','changes reconciled across systems after owner approval'],
  ['philippines-recruiting-requisition-intake-quality','Philippines recruiting requisitions: check readiness before sourcing','Create a requisition-readiness check for Philippines recruiting support while leaders retain budget, role, and selection decisions.','requisition intake quality','whether the role is ready for sourcing or missing approval','a job description is complete but the hiring owner has not approved the opening','treating a polished description as authorization to recruit','requisitions with complete approvals and no unresolved blockers'],
  ['philippines-hr-employee-communication-translation-review','Philippines HR translated communications: protect meaning at review','Route translated employee communications through a qualified review so Philippines-based HR support preserves meaning without giving policy advice.','employee communication translation review','who confirms meaning, audience, and approved delivery','a translated sentence changes a request into an instruction','choosing the most fluent wording without comparing the source','messages with source, reviewer, version, and delivery approval'],
  ['philippines-hr-month-end-people-ops-close','Philippines HR month-end close: reconcile open people tasks','Run a month-end people-ops close that gathers evidence from recurring HR queues while owners retain financial and employment decisions.','month-end people-ops close','which open item affects the close and who resolves it','a late employee change appears after the report has been prepared','closing the month by hiding unmatched items','open items reconciled or explicitly carried forward with owners'],
  ['philippines-hr-employee-file-correction-register','Philippines HR file corrections: preserve before-and-after evidence','Maintain a correction register for employee records so changes are traceable and approved rather than silently overwritten.','employee-file correction registers','whether the request is an administrative correction or a disputed fact','two sources contain different spellings and each appears official','editing the record first and asking for evidence later','corrections with original value, requested value, source, and approval'],
  ['philippines-hr-urgent-request-triage','Philippines HR urgent requests: define urgency with observable signals','Build an urgent-request triage rule for Philippines-based HR support that routes risk without promising a substantive answer.','urgent HR request triage','which observable signal changes the route or response window','a message arrives outside hours and contains both a deadline and a sensitive concern','calling every emotional message urgent while missing a real deadline','urgent items reaching the correct owner within the agreed window'],
  ['philippines-hr-offboarding-shared-work-handoff','Philippines HR offboarding: hand back shared work without losing context','Coordinate shared-work handback during offboarding with a minimal register of files, owners, and approved next actions.','offboarding shared-work handbacks','what must move, what must stay restricted, and who accepts it','a departing employee’s shared folder contains work owned by several teams','transferring an entire folder without classifying ownership or access','handoff items accepted by named owners with access reviewed'],
  ['philippines-hr-employee-record-retention-review','Philippines HR employee-record reviews: separate retention facts from decisions','Run a source-backed employee-record review for Philippines HR support while qualified owners decide retention, access, and any exception.','employee-record retention reviews','which record facts are ready for owner review and which require interpretation','an old document remains visible beside a newer record with a different effective date','treating a retention reminder as permission to delete or disclose a record','review items with source, status, owner, and approved next action']
